)\n    print(f'  {kf}: {size} bytes')\n\"\n0.33 tbn (default)\n    Metadata:\n      handler_name    : VideoHandler\n      vendor_id       : [0][0][0][0]\n      encoder         : Lavc58.134.100 mjpeg\n    Side data:\n      cpb: bitrate max/min/avg: 0/0/200000 buffer size: 0 vbv_delay: N/A\nframe=    1 fps=0.0 q=7.8 size=N/A time=00:00:03.00 bitrate=N/A speed=40.9x\nframe=   10 fps=0.0 q=14.6 Lsize=N/A time=00:00:30.00 bitrate=N/A speed= 124x\nvideo:1226kB audio:0kB subtitle:0kB other streams:0kB global headers:0kB muxing overhead: unknown\n\nExtracted 10 keyframes:\n  frame_0001.jpg: 93673 bytes\n  frame_0002.jpg: 111252 bytes\n  frame_0003.jpg: 143360 bytes\n  frame_0004.jpg: 213800 bytes\n  frame_0005.jpg: 215190 bytes\n  frame_0006.jpg: 145591 bytes\n  frame_0007.jpg: 114793 bytes\n  frame_0008.jpg: 86723 bytes\n  frame_0009.jpg: 70850 bytes\n  frame_0010.jpg: 60640 bytes","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"292fa92a-8aba-47ce-a2c5-9a19f86f71ef","tool_call_id":"call_af93414a5ecb4446b4e493a0","artifact":null,"status":"success"}],"uploaded_files":[{"filename":"Trafic-30s.mp4","size":1533354,"path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4","extension":".mp4"}],"viewed_images":{},"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"把我上传的这个视频登记入库，并建立可以语义搜索的向量索引。","normalized_query":"把我上传的这个视频登记入库，并建立可以语义搜索的向量索引。","routing_query":"场景：表格年鉴。场景ID：table_yearbook。场景说明：统计年鉴、政府公报表格、统计报表、规则数据表、带网格和表头的表格图片或已转换的 table.json/semantic.json 表格数据解析场景。适用于从表格图片或复杂表格中精确定位行列单元格、提取切片、计算占比/合计/同比/排名，并基于 local-table-ocr skill 生成原始表格 JSON、语义增强 JSON、带行列索引的增强图，再通过 get_cell/get_slice 精确取值。。需要识别参数：表格对象、定位依据、计算指标、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将把上传的视频登记入库，并建立支持语义搜索的向量索引","scene":"table_yearbook","scene_name":"表格年鉴","params":{"表格对象":"","定位依据":"","计算指标":"","输出形式":""},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["table_yearbook"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_394206","text":"把我上传的这个视频登记入库，并建立可以语义搜索的向量索引。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_134e95","text":"读取用户上传的视频文件，解析其基础元数据（格式