"content":"太好了！CLIP模型已成功提取10个关键帧的512维视觉语义特征。现在构建FAISS向量索引并完成入库登记：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":1316,"prompt_tokens":19247,"total_tokens":20563,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":38,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":1316},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":19247}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-3f9a9014-d05d-99e8-a1c2-c3d4b293e23f","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e77-8f29-75f2-8728-b1bbf9e47907-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"python -c \"\nimport os, json, hashlib, uuid, numpy as np, faiss\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\n# 读取之前保存的特征和元数据\nfeatures_np = np.load('/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-index/features.npy')\nwith open('/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-index/metadata.json', 'r') as f:\n    metadata = json.load(f)\n\nprint(f'Features shape: {features_np.shape}')\nprint(f'Feature dtype: {features_np.dtype}')\n\n# FAISS要求float32\nif features_np.dtype != np.float32:\n    features_np = features_np.astype(np.float32)\n\n# 构建IVF Flat索引 (适合小规模数据集)\ndimension = features_np.shape[1]\nnlist = min(4, max(1, int(np.sqrt(features_np.shape[0]))))  # 聚类中心数\nprint(f'Building IVF index with nlist={nlist}...')\n\nindex = faiss.IndexFlatL2(dimension)  # L2距离度量\nquantizer = faiss.IndexFlatL2(dimension)\nindex_ivf = faiss.IndexIVFFlat(quantizer, dimension, nlist)\nindex_ivf.train(features_np)\nindex_ivf.add(features_np)\n\n# 保存索引\nfaiss.write_index(index_ivf, '/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-index/faiss_index.index')\n\n# 验证索引质量（测试检索）\nquery_vec = features_np[:1]  # 用第一帧作为查询\nD, I = index_ivf.search(query_vec, k=5)\nprint(f'\\\\nQuery results (self-search):')\nfor i in range(len(I[0])):\n    frame_id = I[0][i] + 1\n    dist = D[0][i]\n    print(f'  Rank {i+1}: Frame {frame_id}, distance={dist:.6f}')\n\n# 生成视频资产的唯一ID\nasset_id = str(uuid.uuid4())[:8].upper()\nvideo_hash = hashlib.md5(open('/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4', 'rb').read()).hexdigest()\n\n# 综合检测结果（来自之前的video_object_analytics）\ndetection_results = {\n    'bus': 5,\n    'car': 26,\n    'total_detections': 31,\n    'frames_analyzed': 3\n}\n\n# 创建完整的入库登记记录\nregistration = {\n    'asset_id': asset_id,\n    'asset_type': 'video',\n    'title': '交通监控视频 - Trafic-30s',\n    'description': '城市道路监控录像，包含公交车和小轿车通行的交通场景',\n    'registered_at': datetime.now().isoformat(),\n    'original_filename': 'Trafic-30s.mp4',\n    'storage_path': '/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4',\n    'file_size_bytes': os.path.getsize('/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4'),\n    'file_hash_md5': video_hash,\n    'video_properties': {\n        'resolution': metadata['resolution'],\n        'fps': metadata['fps'],\n        'duration_seconds': metadata['duration_seconds'],\n        'total_frames': metadata['total_frames'],\n        'codec': 'h264'\n    },\n    'processing_info': {\n        'keyframes_extracted': metadata['keyframes_extracted'],\n        'keyframe_interval_s': 3,\n        'embedding_model': metadata['embedding_model'],\n        'feature_dimension': metadata['feature_dimension'],\n        'index_type': f'IVF{nlist}_FlatL2',\n        'index_file': '/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-index/faiss_index.index',\n        'features_file': '/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-index/features.npy'\n    },\n    'object_detection_summary': detection_results,\n    'semantic_tags': ['traffic', 'road', 'vehicles', 'bus', 'car', 'surveillance', 'urban'],\n    'searchable_fields': [\n        'vehicle_count',\n        'vehicle_types',\n        'scene_description',\n        'semantic_features'\n    ]\n}\n\n# 保存登记记录\noutput_dir = '/mnt/user-data/outputs'\nos.makedirs(output_dir, exist_ok=True)\nreg_file = os.path.join(output_dir, 'video_registration.json')\nwith open(reg_file, 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(registration, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n\n# 同时保存索引配置清单\nindex_config = {\n    'index_type': 'IVF Flat',\n    'quantizer': 'IndexFlatL2',\n    'distance_metric': 'L2 (Euclidean)',\n    'nlist': nlist,\n    'nprobe': 1,  # 搜索时使用的聚类中心数\n    'dimension': dimension,\n    'num_vectors': features_np.shape[0],\n    'top_k_default': 5\n}\n\nconfig_file = os.path.join(output_dir, 'index_configuration.json')\nwith open(config_file, 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(index_config, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n\nprint(f'\\\\n✓ Registration saved to: {reg_file}')\nprint(f'✓ Index config saved to: {config_file}')\nprint(f'✓ Asset ID: {asset_id}')\nprint(f'✓ MD5 Hash: {video_hash}')\n\"\n","description":"构建FAISS向量索引并生成完整入库登记记录"},"id":"call_90210300d7c941d297ad881f","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":19247,"output_tokens":1316,"total_tokens":20563,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":38}}},{"content":"python -c \"\nimport os, json, hashlib, uuid, numpy as np, faiss\nfrom datetime import datetime\n# 读取之前保存的特征和元数据\nfeatures_np = np.load('/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-index/features.npy')\nwith open('/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-index/metadata.json', 'r') as f:\n    metadata = json.load(f)\nprint(f'Features shape: {features_np.shape}')\nprint(f'Feature dtype: {features_np.dtype}')\n# FAISS要求float32\nif features_np.dtype != np.float32:\n    features_np = features_np.astype(np.float32)\n# 构建IVF Flat索引 (适合小规模数据集)\ndimension = features_np.shape[1]\nnlist = min(4, max(1, int(np.sqrt(features_np.shape[0]))))  # 聚类中心数\nprint(f'Building IVF index with nlist={nlist}...')\nindex = faiss.IndexFlatL2(dimension)  # L2距离度量\nquantizer = faiss.IndexFlatL2(dimension)\nindex_ivf = faiss.IndexIVFFlat(quantizer, dimension, nlist)\nindex_ivf.train(features_np)\nindex_ivf.add(features_np)\n# 保存索引\nfaiss.write_index(index_ivf, '/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-index/faiss_index.index')\n# 验证索引质量（测试检索）\nquery_vec = features_np[:1]  # 用第一帧作为查询\nD, I = index_ivf.search(query_vec, k=5)\nprint(f'\\\\nQuery results (self-search):')\nfor i in range(len(I[0])):\n    frame_id = I[0][i] + 1\n    dist = D[0][i]\n    print(f'  Rank {i+1}: Frame {frame_id}, distance={dist:.6f}')\n# 生成视频资产的唯一ID\nasset_id = str(uuid.uuid4())[:8].upper()\nvideo_hash = hashlib.md5(open('/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4', 'rb').read()).hexdigest()\n# 综合检测结果（来自之前的video_object_analytics）\ndetection_results = {\n    'bus': 5,\n    'car': 26,\n    'total_detections': 31,\n    'frames_analyzed': 3\n}\n# 创建完整的入库登记记录\nregistration = {\n    'asset_id': asset_id,\n    'asset_type': 'video',\n    'title': '交通监控视频 - Trafic-30s',\n    'description': '城市道路监控录像，包含公交车和小轿车通行的交通场景',\n    'registered_at': datetime.now().isoformat(),\n    'original_filename': 'Trafic-30s.mp4',\n    'storage_path': '/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4',\n    'file_size_bytes': os.path.getsize('/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4'),\n    'file_hash_md5': video_hash,\n    'video_properties': {\n        'resolution': metadata['resolution'],\n        'fps': metadata['fps'],\n        'duration_seconds': metadata['duration_seconds'],\n        'total_frames': metadata['total_frames'],\n        'codec': 'h264'\n    },\n    'processing_info': {\n        'keyframes_extracted': metadata['keyframes_extracted'],\n        'keyframe_interval_s': 3,\n        'embedding_model': metadata['embedding_model'],\n        'feature_dimension': metadata['feature_dimension'],\n        'index_type': f'IVF{nlist}_FlatL2',\n        'index_file': '/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-index/faiss_index.index',\n        'features_file': '/mnt/user-data/workspace/video-index/features.npy'\n    },\n    'object_detection_summary': detection_results,\n    'semantic_tags': ['traffic', 'road', 'vehicles', 'bus', 'car', 'surveillance', 'urban'],\n    'searchable_fields': [\n        'vehicle_count',\n        'vehicle_types',\n        'scene_description',\n        'semantic_features'\n    ]\n}\n# 保存登记记录\noutput_dir = '/mnt/user-data/outputs'\nos.makedirs(output_dir, exist_ok=True)\nreg_file = os.path.join(output_dir, 'video_registration.json')\nwith open(reg_file, 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(registration, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\n# 同时保存索引配置清单\nindex_config = {\n    'index_type': 'IVF Flat',\n    'quantizer': 'IndexFlatL2',\n    'distance_metric': 'L2 (Euclidean)',\n    'nlist': nlist,\n    'nprobe': 1,  # 搜索时使用的聚类中心数\n    'dimension': dimension,\n    'num_vectors': features_np.shape[0],\n    'top_k_default': 5\n}\nconfig_file = os.path.join(output_dir, 'index_configuration.json')\nwith open(config_file, 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(index_config, f, indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\nprint(f'\\\\n✓ Registration saved to: {reg_file}')\nprint(f'✓ Index config saved to: {config_file}')\nprint(f'✓ Asset ID: {asset_id}')\nprint(f'✓ MD5 Hash: {video_hash}')\n\"\nFeatures shape: (10, 512)\nFeature dtype: float32\nBuilding IVF index with nlist=3...\nWARNING clustering 10 points to 3 centroids: please provide at least 117 training points\n\nQuery results (self-search):\n  Rank 1: Frame 1, distance=0.000000\n  Rank 2: Frame 2, distance=0.041969\n  Rank 3: Frame 3, distance=0.082080\n  Rank 4: Frame 9, distance=0.132501\n  Rank 5: Frame 10, distance=0.143734\n\n✓ Registration saved to: /mnt/user-data/outputs/video_registration.json\n✓ Index config saved to: /mnt/user-data/outputs/index_configuration.json\n✓ Asset ID: 3B3D5A43\n✓ MD5 Hash: da38e2d29b12a5da09beda1eaed2c895","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"9708df65-e00d-4ef6-9d31-98a46396428e","tool_call_id":"call_90210300d7c941d297ad881f","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"视频已成功登记入库并建立向量索引。现在生成入库状态报告：\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":980,"prompt_tokens":21970,"total_tokens":22950,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":18,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":980},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":21970}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-ecca254d-cf75-942d-97e4-53e3953b775f","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e77-c252-7f12-898b-4f5c3b3d0fbf-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"python -c \"\nimport json, os\n\n# 读取登记记录\nwith open('/mnt/user-data/outputs/video_registration.json', 'r') as f:\n    reg = json.load(f)\n\n# 输出结构化报告\nprint('=' * 70)\nprint('           视 频 资 产 入 库 登 记 报 告')\nprint('=' * 70)\nprint()\nprint(f'📋 资产编号:     {reg[\\\"asset_id\\\"]}')\nprint(f'🎬 资产标题:     {reg[\\\"title\\\"]}')\nprint(f'📝 资产描述:     {reg[\\\"description\\\"]}')\nprint(f'🕐 登记时间:     {reg[\\\"registered_at\\\"]}')\nprint()\nprint('-' * 70)\nprint('📦 原始文件信息')\nprint('-' * 70)\nprint(f'  文件名:       {reg[\\\"original_filename\\\"]}')\nprint(f'  存储路径:     {reg[\\\"storage_path\\\"]}')\nprint(f'  文件大小:     {reg[\\\"file_size_bytes\\\"] / 1024:.1f} KB')\nprint(f'  MD5校验值:    {reg[\\\"file_hash_md5\\\"]}')\nprint()\nprint('-' * 70)\nprint('🎥 视频属性')\nprint('-' * 70)\nvp = reg['video_properties']\nprint(f'  分辨率:       {vp[\\\"resolution\\\"]}')\nprint(f'  帧率:         {vp[\\\"fps\\\"]} fps')\nprint(f'  时长:         {vp[\\\"duration_seconds\\\"]} 秒')\nprint(f'  总帧数:       {vp[\\\"total_frames\\\"]} 帧')\nprint(f'  编码格式:     {vp[\\\"codec\\\"]}')\nprint()\nprint('-' * 70)\nprint('🔍 对象检测结果 (YOLOv8n)')\nprint('-' * 70)\nod = reg['object_detection_summary']\nprint(f'  公交车:       {od[\\\"bus\\\"]} 辆')\nprint(f'  小轿车:       {od[\\\"car\\\"]} 辆')\nprint(f'  检测总数:     {od[\\\"total_detections\\\"]} 次')\nprint(f'  分析帧数:     {od[\\\"frames_analyzed\\\"]} 帧')\nprint()\nprint('-' * 70)\nprint('🧠 语义向量化配置')\nprint('-' * 70)\npi = reg['processing_info']\nprint(f'  提取关键帧:   {pi[\\\"keyframes_extracted\\\"]} 帧 (每{pi[\\\"keyframe_interval_s\\\"]}秒)')\nprint(f'  Embedding模型: {pi[\\\"embedding_model\\\"]}')\nprint(f'  特征维度:     {pi[\\\"feature_dimension\\\"]}')\nprint(f'  索引类型:     {pi[\\\"index_type\\\"]}')\nprint(f'  距离度量:     L2 (欧几里得距离)')\nprint()\nprint('-' * 70)\nprint('🏷️ 语义标签')\nprint('-' * 70)\nprint(f'  {\\\", \\\".join(reg[\\\"semantic_tags\\\"])}')\nprint()\nprint('-' * 70)\nprint('💾 索引文件位置')\nprint('-' * 70)\nprint(f'  向量索引:     {pi[\\\"index_file\\\"]}')\nprint(f'  特征数据:     {pi[\\\"features_file\\\"]}')\nprint(f'  登记记录:     /mnt/user-data/outputs/video_registration.json')\nprint(f'  索引配置:     /mnt/user-data/outputs/index_configuration.json')\nprint()\nprint('=' * 70)\nprint('✅ 入库状态: 已完成 | 索引状态: 已就绪')\nprint('=' * 70)\n\"\n","description":"生成完整的入库登记状态报告"},"id":"call_25c0454ebe424802a17924db","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":21970,"output_tokens":980,"total_tokens":22950,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":18}}}],"thread_data":{"workspace_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/5508a9f2-b713-4f51-8153-457c24ac067f/user-data/workspace","uploads_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/5508a9f2-b713-4f51-8153-457c24ac067f/user-data/uploads","outputs_path":"/app/backend/.deer-flow/threads/5508a9f2-b713-4f51-8153-457c24ac067f/user-data/outputs"},"title":"Video Registration and Semantic Indexing","artifacts":[],"raw_messages":[{"content":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n把我上传的这个视频登记入库，并建立可以语义搜索的向量索引。","additional_kwargs":{"files":[{"filename":"Trafic-30s.mp4","size":1533354,"path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4","status":"uploaded"}]},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"a1edf2a4-0490-4484-b7f5-54c62ad37fbb"},{"content":"<skill_system source=\"skill_router\">\nYou have access to skills that provide optimized workflows for specific tasks. Each skill contains best practices, frameworks, and references to additional resources.\n\n**Skill Availability Rules:**\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt are available across turns.\n- Custom/domain skills are available only when listed in a current-turn routed <available_skills> section.\n- Ignore custom/domain skills mentioned in previous turns if they are not listed in the current turn.\n- Do not call tools associated with unavailable skills.\n- If a later current-turn routed_skill_prompt is injected by SkillRouter, its <available_skills> list recommends the custom/domain skills for this turn; public skills from the base prompt remain available as supporting workflows.\n- When SkillRouter ranking is disabled and scene filtering injects all skills for a scene, treat <available_skills> as an allowed candidate set. Select the specific skill or skills that match the current user request before loading skill files or executing workflows.\n\nScene skill filter result: SkillRouter ranking is disabled. Detected scene(s): table_yearbook. The listed custom/domain skills are all enabled skills for the detected scene. Treat them as an allowed candidate set, choose the specific matching skill or skills for the task, and then load only the chosen skill file(s). Public skills from the base prompt remain available.\nTask: <uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n把我上传的这个视频登记入库，并建立可以语义搜索的向量索引。\n\n**Current Available Skills:**\n- The current <available_skills> list is empty.\n- No routed custom/domain skill matched this turn.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available.\n\n**Override Scope:**\n- This routed <skill_system> lists recommended custom/domain skills for the current turn.\n- It does NOT replace the base system prompt.\n- Public skills listed in the base system prompt remain available for supporting operations.\n- When uploaded structured files (Excel, CSV, JSON, Parquet, or similar tabular evidence) are central to the user's request, use the public data-analysis skill first to inspect and extract facts before domain synthesis.\n- Continue following language_policy, clarification_system, working_directory, response_style, and critical_reminders from the base system prompt.\n\n**Progressive Loading Pattern:**\n1. When a user query matches an available skill's use case, first choose the concrete skill.\n2. Call `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode for that selected skill to create and validate the SkillInputEnvelope and legacy invocation package.\n3. Read the returned skill file path and understand the skill's workflow and instructions.\n4. The skill file contains references to external resources under the same folder.\n5. Load referenced resources only when needed during execution.\n6. Follow the skill's instructions precisely.\n7. After legacy execution, call `invoke_skill` in `wrap_output` mode to normalize the result into SkillResult when a machine-readable Skill output is needed.\n\n**Mandatory Skill Execution Discipline:**\n- Calling `invoke_skill` in `prepare` mode is NOT sufficient. It only prepares the selected Skill invocation. After `prepare`, you MUST actually execute the selected Skill workflow.\n- After `invoke_skill(mode=\"prepare\")` returns `legacy_invocation.container_skill_file`, you MUST read that Skill file and treat it as the authoritative execution guide.\n- If the Skill provides scripts, commands, templates, references, or executable workflows, you MUST use those Skill-provided assets first.\n- Do NOT replace a matched Skill workflow with ad hoc Python, pandas, SQL, shell, or manual analysis code before attempting the Skill workflow.\n- For `data-analysis`, if `/mnt/skills/public/data-analysis/scripts/analyze.py` is available and the task is structured data analysis, you MUST call that script first for data inspection, SQL query, aggregation, statistics, or chart preparation. Do not write standalone pandas code for the same operation before trying this script.\n- Custom code is allowed only after one of these conditions is true:\n  1. the selected Skill file does not provide a suitable executable workflow;\n  2. the Skill-provided script or workflow has been attempted and failed;\n  3. the user explicitly requests custom code;\n  4. the required operation is clearly outside the Skill's documented capability.\n- When you fall back to custom code, briefly state that the Skill workflow was insufficient or failed, and continue from the Skill result or error.\n\n**Skill Loading Priority Rules:**\n- If a request clearly matches an available skill and also includes uploaded files, load the skill file before reading uploaded data files.\n- Do NOT read a full uploaded structured data file before loading the matched skill.\n- For uploaded structured data files, use small previews only when needed.\n- Prefer the matched skill's scripts, workflows, or tools for actual analysis.\n- Do not start by generating ad hoc JS, Python, SQL, or shell scripts when a matched skill exists.\n- Only improvise custom code after loading the matched skill and confirming the skill does not already provide a suitable workflow.\n\n**Skills are located at:** /mnt/skills\n\n<available_skills>\n</available_skills>\n\n</skill_system>","additional_kwargs":{"message_type":"routed_skill_prompt","internal":true},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"routing_skill_guidance","id":"0000e7cf-8717-4e24-8280-8456809183ee"},{"content":"<system_reminder>\nUse the following current-turn intent and routing guidance when deciding whether to create or update todos. Treat it as planning context, not as a user request.\n<hidden_step source=\"intent_recognition\" title=\"意图识别\">\n改写后的任务：场景：表格年鉴。场景ID：table_yearbook\n识别场景：表格年鉴 (table_yearbook)；场景模式：single；候选场景：table_yearbook\n任务切分：\n- 把我上传的这个视频登记入库，并建立可以语义搜索的向量索引。\n任务规划：\n1. 读取用户上传的视频文件，解析其基础元数据（格式、时长、分辨率），并按固定时间间隔抽取关键帧或调用语音转写服务提取音视频文本内容，形成结构化预处理样本集。\n2. 基于多模态特征提取模型对预处理样本集进行向量化编码，明确向量维度与相似度计算口径，生成标准化的语义特征数据集。\n3. 配置向量检索引擎参数（含索引算法类型、树深/邻居数设置及距离度量方式），将特征数据集写入存储并完成索引构建，验证检索延迟与召回率指标。\n4. 在目标资产库中创建视频登记记录，绑定视频唯一标识、物理存储路径、索引版本信息及特征数据映射关系，完成入库注册与元数据固化。\n5. 核对索引构建完整度与登记字段准确性，输出包含资产ID、索引配置清单、入库状态报告及后续语义检索操作指引的结构化交付物。\n场景任务：\n- table_yearbook: 我将把上传的视频登记入库，并建立支持语义搜索的向量索引。\n已提取参数：{'表格对象': '', '定位依据': '', '计算指标': '', '输出形式': ''}\n任务提示：\n- 提取必填参数：表格对象。需要解析的统计年鉴截图、政府公报表格、报表图片、带表头和网格的数据表、Excel 转换表格、table.json 或 semantic.json 文件\n- 提取可选参数：定位依据。用于定位目标数据的行名、列名、表头层级、指标名称、统计口径、单元格坐标或切片范围\n- 提取可选参数：计算指标。需要提取或计算的目标，如单元格取值、行/列切片、合计、占比、同比、环比、排名、平均值、最大值、最小值等\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如精确数值、计算过程、表格摘要、结构化 JSON、报告、验证结果或可回溯单元格证据\n</hidden_step>\n</system_reminder>","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":"todo_routing_guidance","id":"1333eb78-eeb7-4d4a-b947-6e3162eabebf"},{"content":"我来帮你完成视频的登记入库和语义向量索引构建。首先让我分析视频内容并提取关键信息。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":152,"prompt_tokens":11020,"total_tokens":11172,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":35,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":152},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":11020}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-5e450eae-0380-92a9-b559-8f0f68f69109","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e75-a64a-7c21-8edd-bb2c7522950b-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"video_object_analytics","args":{"capture_seconds":2,"camera_id":"CAM_DEERFLOW_001","operation":"detect","video_path":"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4"},"id":"call_7c01ed8691dc42c5b9bf4824","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":11020,"output_tokens